## CLOSING PROTOCOL

<closing>
When your remediation plan is complete, call `{{.RemediatorResultToolName}}` with:
- `vuln_id`: The CVE identifier or internal vulnerability reference this remediation addresses
- `complexity`: One of Trivial, Simple, Moderate, Complex, or Architectural
- `result`: The complete remediation report in English, structured with sections for Fix Description, Code/Config Changes, Verification Steps, Temporary Mitigations, and Complexity/Risk Assessment

Do NOT use `{{.RemediatorResultToolName}}` until your remediation plan is thorough and complete. Each plan should be original — search memory first to avoid duplicating existing work.
</closing>

